<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="es">
<head>
<meta charset="UTF-8" />
<meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0" />
<title>¡Solicitud recibida! | InmoFlow</title>
<meta name="robots" content="noindex, nofollow" />
<meta name="theme-color" content="#526a5d" />
<link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.googleapis.com">
<link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.gstatic.com" crossorigin>
<link href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Inter:wght@400;500;600;700;800&display=swap" rel="stylesheet">
<style>
  :root{
    --bg:#fbfbf8;--surface:#ffffff;--text:#22313a;--muted:#66727a;--line:#dfe5df;
    --accent:#6d8677;--accent-dark:#526a5d;--shadow:0 18px 50px rgba(36,52,45,.08);
  }
  *{box-sizing:border-box}
  html{background:var(--bg)}
  body{
    margin:0;min-height:100vh;display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;
    font-family:Inter,system-ui,-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,"Segoe UI",sans-serif;
    background:var(--bg);color:var(--text);padding:24px;line-height:1.55;
  }
  .card{
    max-width:480px;width:100%;background:var(--surface);border:1px solid var(--line);
    border-radius:20px;box-shadow:var(--shadow);padding:44px 36px;text-align:center;
  }
  .check{
    width:56px;height:56px;border-radius:50%;background:#edf2ed;color:var(--accent-dark);
    display:grid;place-items:center;margin:0 auto 20px;
  }
  .brand{display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;gap:10px;font-weight:800;letter-spacing:-.03em;margin-bottom:22px;color:var(--accent-dark)}
  .brand-mark{width:24px;height:24px;border:2px solid var(--accent);border-radius:7px 7px 9px 9px}
  h1{font-size:26px;letter-spacing:-.03em;margin:0 0 12px}
  p{color:var(--muted);font-size:15px;margin:0 0 8px}
  .btn{
    display:inline-flex;align-items:center;gap:8px;margin-top:22px;min-height:46px;padding:0 22px;
    border-radius:999px;background:var(--accent);color:#fff;font-weight:700;font-size:14px;
    text-decoration:none;
  }
  .btn:hover{background:var(--accent-dark)}
</style>
</head>
<body>
  <div class="card">
    <span class="brand"><span class="brand-mark" aria-hidden="true"></span>InmoFlow</span>
    <div class="check" aria-hidden="true">
      <svg width="26" height="26" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.5" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><polyline points="20 6 9 17 4 12"/></svg>
    </div>
    <h1>¡Solicitud recibida!</h1>
    <p>Gracias por escribirnos. Hemos recibido tu solicitud de demo y te responderemos en menos de 24 h laborables a la dirección que nos has dejado.</p>
    <p>Mientras tanto, si tienes prisa, escríbenos directamente a <a href="mailto:hola@inmoflow.es">hola@inmoflow.es</a>.</p>
    <a class="btn" href="/tarjeta/inmoflow">Volver al inicio</a>
  </div>
</body>
</html>
